        "grammar_note": "'Říká, že je unavená.' = She says that she is tired. 'Říká' = she says (3rd person sing. of 'říkat'). 'Že' introduces the reported speech. 'Je unavená' = she is tired (feminine -á ending agrees with female subject). The pronoun 'ona' can be omitted — the verb ending already indicates the subject."
